# Read `docs/agents/CLAUDE.md` first

The rules for the agents feature — everything that trades, quotes or reads a venue, its studies and its
pre-registrations — moved from `.claude/CLAUDE.md` to `docs/agents/CLAUDE.md` on 2026-10-03. Read it, and
`docs/agents/reference.md`, before changing anything under these paths. `.claude/CLAUDE.md` still applies.
